      "grammarFocus": "за + accusative",
      "sentenceRef": "Мы поехали за город.",
      "explanation": "'За город' (with a motion verb) means 'to the countryside' or 'out of the city'. 'Поехать за город' = to go to the countryside. When already there: 'за городом' (instrumental, location) = outside the city. Compare: 'Мы поехали за город' (motion) vs. 'Мы живём за городом' (location). The expression 'на даче' (at the dacha) is also common.",
