      "explanation": "'Ходить за' + instrumental means 'to go to get/gather something'. 'Ходить за грибами' = to go mushroom picking. This is a common Russian pattern for gathering activities: 'ходить за ягодами' (to go berry picking), 'пойти за хлебом' (to go get bread), 'сходить за молоком' (to go fetch milk). The instrumental case shows the purpose.",
